Package: reflutter
Version: 0.9.8
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Alienkrishn [Anon4You]
Depends: python, python-pip
Section: security
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/Impact-I/reFlutter
Description: Reverse-engineer Flutter apps and intercept their traffic
 reFlutter swaps a Flutter app's engine with a prebuilt patched one
 (repack mode) or instruments the app's own engine at runtime (attach mode).
 It disables BoringSSL certificate verification so Flutter traffic can be
 intercepted with a proxy, with no root or certificate installation needed.
